hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1134","Yusuf bin Musa and Muhammad bin Issa told us, saying: Jarir told us, on the authority of Abd al-Malik bin Umair, on the authority of Muhammad bin al-Muntashir, on the authority of Humaid Ibn Abd al-Rahman, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, referring it to the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, and Yusuf said: He refers it to him. He said: He was asked which prayer is better after What is written? Which fast is better after the month of Ramadan? He said: “The best prayer after the obligatory prayer is prayer in the middle of the night, and the best fasting after the month of Ramadan, God’s month of Muharram.”"
